		<name>shopservation</name>
		<summary>Loud alarm for matching shopservatory finds</summary>
		<desc>Companion app for a self-hosted shopservatory instance.

shopservation polls your shopservatory listing feed and sounds a loud alarm
when a new find matches a rule you configure in the app. Rules match on title
keywords, exclusion keywords, a maximum price (per currency) and source.

The alarm plays on the alarm audio stream, so it is audible even when the
phone is on silent or vibrate, and shows a full-screen stop screen over the
lock screen.

All alarm logic lives in the app; the server needs no changes.
</desc>
